# a function that calls last what arrives at a parameter ends its tail calls if what arrives there ends its own: whoever hands it a closure of such a function may keep his frame
# function leaf(v) { return v.x }  function last(f, v) { return f(v) }  function passes(v, f) { return last(f, v) }  function either(f, g, v) { if (f) return f(v); return g(v) }
# `passes` hands its own parameter on to `last` in tail position, and the condition goes with it. `either` calls `f` by the name that the test of it gives
# function maker(v) { return last(toLeaf, v) }, toLeaf = v => leaf(v). The condition is met, so `maker` ends its tail calls whatever arrives. So does `both`, which meets both conditions of `either`
# toMaker = v => maker(v) jumps to a function that ends, and function outer(v) { return passes(v, toMaker) } hands it on: a closure may owe its word to another closure
# function round(v) { return last(toRound, v) }, toRound = v => round(v). A ring that goes through the closure: neither has a word, and each turn is three jumps. `spin` and `toSpin` are the same two in the other order
# function blind(v) { return last(callsIt, v) }, callsIt = v => v(v). The closure has a condition of its own, and nobody knows what meets it
# function oneOfTwo(v) { return either(toLeaf, toRound, v) } meets one condition of two
# f1 = leaf, f2 = last, f3 = passes, f4 = toLeaf, f5 = maker, f6 = toRound, f7 = round, f8 = callsIt, f9 = blind, f10 = either, f11 = both, f12 = oneOfTwo, f13 = toMaker, f14 = outer, f15 = toLeafToo, f16 = spin, f17 = toSpin
# last, passes, maker, round, blind, either, both, oneOfTwo, outer and spin are handed to sink, so nobody lists what arrives at `f` and `g`
# RUN: plan units mechanisms=none+DirectCalls
# CHECK: unit f1:Body {{*}}ends-its-tail-calls
# CHECK: unit f2:Body {{*}}ends-tail-calls-if-arguments-do=[0]
# CHECK: unit f3:Body {{*}}ends-tail-calls-if-arguments-do=[1]
# CHECK: unit f4:Body {{*}}ends-its-tail-calls
# CHECK: unit f5:Body {{*}}ends-its-tail-calls
# CHECK: unit f8:Body {{*}}ends-tail-calls-if-arguments-do=[0]
# CHECK: unit f10:Body {{*}}ends-tail-calls-if-arguments-do=[0, 1]
# CHECK: unit f11:Body {{*}}ends-its-tail-calls
# CHECK: unit f13:Body {{*}}ends-its-tail-calls
# CHECK: unit f14:Body {{*}}ends-its-tail-calls
# CHECK: unit f15:Body {{*}}ends-its-tail-calls
# RUN(NEVER): plan units mechanisms=none+DirectCalls
# NEVER-NOT: unit f2:Body {{*}}ends-its-tail-calls
# NEVER-NOT: unit f3:Body {{*}}ends-its-tail-calls
# NEVER-NOT: unit f6:Body {{*}}tail-calls
# NEVER-NOT: unit f7:Body {{*}}tail-calls
# NEVER-NOT: unit f9:Body {{*}}tail-calls
# NEVER-NOT: unit f12:Body {{*}}tail-calls
# NEVER-NOT: unit f16:Body {{*}}tail-calls
# NEVER-NOT: unit f17:Body {{*}}tail-calls
# RUN(WITHHELD): plan units mechanisms=none
# WITHHELD-NOT: tail-calls

